{"id":"payrolla-salary","request":"When Payrolla posts an approved payroll to our webhook, check the iswallet funding wallet balance, get a payroll approver to approve it, then pay each employee by iswallet wallet transfer or bank payout, at most 5 at a time, and report who was paid and who failed back to Payrolla.","expect":{"connectors":["iswallet@1"],"steps":["approval","foreach","connector"],"trigger":"webhook","properties":["approval_before_payment","idempotency","webhook_auth","bounded_concurrency","reads_before_paying"]},"tags":["dogfood","payments","approval"],"difficulty":"hard","source":"dogfood"}
{"id":"ispend-credit-exceptions","request":"When iswallet rejects or reverses a customer's wallet credit, tell iSpend's internal API about the exception and post it to the ops Slack channel at the same time.","expect":{"connectors":["iswallet@1"],"steps":["parallel","http"],"trigger":"connector_event"},"tags":["dogfood","payments","alerting"],"difficulty":"medium","source":"dogfood"}
{"id":"ops-payout-failure","request":"When an iswallet payout fails or is reversed, text the on-call engineer with Termii and post the details to Slack.","expect":{"connectors":["iswallet@1","termii@1"],"steps":["connector"],"trigger":"connector_event","properties":["no_hardcoded_contacts"]},"tags":["dogfood","alerting"],"difficulty":"easy","source":"dogfood"}
{"id":"topup-reconciliation","request":"Every 15 minutes, find top-ups in our Postgres database that have been pending for more than 15 minutes, check each one against Paystack, and mark it credited or failed.","expect":{"connectors":["postgres@1","paystack@1"],"steps":["foreach","connector"],"trigger":"schedule","properties":["bounded_concurrency"]},"tags":["dogfood","schedule","database"],"difficulty":"hard","source":"dogfood"}
{"id":"loan-disbursement","request":"When our loan system sends an approved loan to a webhook, verify the borrower's BVN with Dojah, get a credit officer to approve, then send the money with Paystack.","expect":{"connectors":["dojah@1","paystack@1"],"steps":["approval","connector"],"trigger":"webhook","properties":["approval_before_payment","idempotency","webhook_auth"]},"tags":["payments","identity","approval"],"difficulty":"medium","source":"synthetic"}
{"id":"high-value-two-approvers","request":"Pay supplier invoices posted to a webhook through Flutterwave; invoices above 5 million naira need a finance manager and then the CFO to approve, smaller ones only a finance manager.","expect":{"connectors":["flutterwave@1"],"steps":["approval","connector"],"trigger":"webhook","properties":["approval_before_payment","idempotency","webhook_auth"]},"tags":["payments","approval","policy"],"difficulty":"hard","source":"synthetic"}
{"id":"kyc-onboarding","request":"When a new customer signs up, verify their NIN with Prembly; if it matches, send them a welcome SMS with Termii, otherwise email the compliance team with Gmail.","expect":{"connectors":["prembly@1","termii@1","gmail@1"],"steps":["branch","connector"]},"tags":["identity","messaging"],"difficulty":"medium","source":"synthetic"}
